[[Aurora]] is a [[legendary trinket]] obtainable through [[Living World Season 3]]. All six episodes must be unlocked in order to craft this item. Progress can be started by obtaining the [[Sentient Seed]] from the [[Gleam of Sentience]].
== Lore ==
{{Legendary unlock text|When [[Mordremoth]]'s power seeped into the earth, some sought to harness it, control it - bringing forth new dangers. Heroes faced those enemies head on with a spark of bravery and a warrior's might.}}

== Acquisition ==
=== Contained in ===
{{contained in}}

