=== Achievements ===
The following achievements are required to acquire the necessary materials for crafting:
* {{achievement icon|Legendary Trinkets}}: [[Aurora: Awakening]] — for {{item icon|Gift of Valor}}, required to craft a {{item icon|Gift of Sentience}}.<br>Unlocked by purchasing the {{item icon|Sentient Seed}} for {{token|um|1000}} from the {{item icon|Gleam of Sentience}} [[converter]], obtained by combining the following 4 converters in the [[Mystic Forge]], each rewarded for completing their respective achievement:

:* {{item icon|Sentient Anomaly}} from {{achievement|Conspiracy of Dunces}}
:* {{item icon|Sentient Aberration}} from {{achievement|Token Collector}}
:* {{item icon|Sentient Oddity}} from {{achievement|Cin Business}}
:* {{item icon|Sentient Singularity}} from {{achievement|Lessons Learned}}

* {{achievement icon|Legendary Trinkets}}: [[Aurora II: Empowering]] — for {{item icon|Spark of Sentience}}. Unlocked after completing Aurora: Awakening.

== Graphics ==
{{main|Legendary trinket#Visual effects}}
[[Aurora]], [[Coalescence]] and [[Vision]] — share the same visual effect, which depends on the number of these trinkets worn and displayed at the same time.
* With weapons stowed, an ethereal [[Cosmetic Aura|aura]] will appear around the player.
* With weapons drawn, four orbs or bubbles will orbit the player's head.

