Crafting {{item icon|Gift of Draconic Mastery}} requires 250 of each map-specific currency from the Living World Season 3 maps. If not already completed, the following {{achievement icon|Side Stories}} ([[Living World Return]]) achievements can help obtain the required currencies:
* {{achievement icon|Return to Out of the Shadows}}: [[Return to Bloodstone Fen]] <small>Tier 3 (7 achievements)</small> — [[Blood Ruby Strongbox|5 Blood Ruby Strongboxes]] ({{token|br|250}})
* {{achievement icon|Return to Rising Flames}}: [[Return to Ember Bay]] <small>Tier 3 (6 achievements)</small> — [[Sack of Petrified Wood|5 Sacks of Petrified Wood]] ({{token|pw|250}})
* {{achievement icon|Return to A Crack in the Ice}}: [[Return to Bitterfrost Frontier]] <small>Tier 3 (6 achievements)</small> — [[Winterberry Strongbox|5 Winterberry Strongboxes]] ({{token|fw|500}})
* {{achievement icon|Return to The Head of the Snake}}: [[Return to Lake Doric]] <small>Tier 3 (7 achievements)</small> — [[Jade Shard Strongbox|5 Jade Shard Strongboxes]] ({{token|js|500}})
* {{achievement icon|Return to Flashpoint}}: [[Return to Draconis Mons]] <small>Tier 3 (7 achievements)</small> — [[Fire Orchid Strongbox|5 Fire Orchid Strongboxes]] ({{token|fob|250}})
* {{achievement icon|Return to One Path Ends}}: [[Return to Siren's Landing]] <small>Tier 3 (7 achievements)</small> — [[Orrian Pearl Strongbox|5 Orrian Pearl Strongboxes]] ({{token|op|250}})

Completing the {{achievement icon|page=Aurora: Awakening}} achievement for {{item icon|Gift of Valor}} and to unlock {{achievement icon|page=Aurora II: Empowering}} requires an additional:
* {{token|br|50}} to purchase {{item icon|Pristine Blood Ruby}}
* {{token|js|100}} to purchase {{item icon|Seraph Seraph Protector}} and {{item icon|Seraph Bloodstone Savant's Staff}}
* {{token|fob|76}} for the collections involved in obtaining {{item icon|The Wayfarer's Henge}}
* {{token|op|200}} to purchase the back item for {{item icon|Supporter of the Gods}}

